Then lock_origin_availability will set origin_availability_locked and origin_availability_confirmed.

Similarly for destination: assign_operator_resource(destination_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha). Then lock_destination_availability(destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha driver_operator_alpha). That will set destination_availability_locked and confirmed.

Now we have origin_availability_locked and confirmed, destination_availability_locked and confirmed.

